ove_Goods.gif?t=1744227757\" /><strong>\u200e </strong>  <br>   <br>   <br><strong>\u200e </strong>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614600/extras/Expand___Upgrade.png?t=1744227757\" />\u200e   <br>\u25ab\ufe0f<strong>Grow your supermarket, improve the interiors, and add new sections as your business flourishes. </strong>    <br>     <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614600/extras/Expand_and_Upgrade.gif?t=1744227757\" /><strong> </strong>    <br>\u200e  <br><strong>\u2666\u00a0Every decision counts! Can you turn your small store into the city's best supermarket?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614600?t=1744227757","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614600/c759ed9bd06b6ec424b554ad6e67f4fc4262848d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744227757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614600/0cc624bddb3b6f528770dddf292116efeb0cbb59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744227757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614600/0cc624bddb3b6f528770dddf292116efeb0cbb59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744227757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614600/extras/Build___Manage_Your_Own_Supermarket.png?t=1744227757\" />\u200e<br>\u25ab\ufe0f<strong>Start small and grow your store. Arrange shelves, manage aisles, and keep things running smoothly.</strong><br><strong>\u200e</strong><br><strong>\u200e</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai